cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "hermes-scout: semantic search over local files"
authors:
  - family-names: Shittu
    given-names: Lanre
abstract: >-
  A Hermes Agent plugin and command line tool that searches local text files by meaning. Files are split into
  overlapping line-aligned chunks, embedded through any OpenAI-compatible embeddings endpoint
  and ranked by cosine similarity, with an incremental SQLite index.
version: 0.2.0
date-released: 2026-11-22
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/Shizoqua/hermes-scout"
url: "https://shizoqua.github.io/hermes-scout/"
keywords:
  - semantic search
  - embeddings
  - retrieval
  - rag
  - hermes-agent
